    "message": "<span class="alert-parameter">fontDirection</span> <code class="alert-value">vertical-rl</code> is not yet implemented. Vertical text layout (writing-mode) is planned, primarily to support Japanese, but is not available yet. Please use <code class="alert-value">ltr</code> or <code class="alert-value">rtl</code>.",
